    "username": "tuturetom",
    "nickname": "TutureTom",
    "text": "正式开源 motion-anything 🚀 免费版Figma Motion + 无水印动效视频工坊来了！\n \n你的 Agent 现在可以把模糊的\"感觉\"直接变成顶尖动效，也支持对 HTML 或视频中任一元素进行编辑🔥\n\n4.6 万行代码！403个动效 · 230 Skills · 59 设计系统 · 2680 icons，8+ code agent + BYOK ，7 种导出格式💥\n\n地址👉 https://t.co/Guk3KrgUzr",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/tuturetom/status/2074429490357235772",
    "time": "2026-07-07 17:45",
    "created_at": "Tue Jul 07 09:45:06 +0000 2026",
    "id_str": "2074429490357235772",
    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "tuturetom",
    "nickname": "TutureTom",
    "text": "1）motion-anything 是让动效活在\"能直接上线的页面\"里的开源工具。设计小白零门槛：不用懂任何术语，说\"感觉\"就能出顶尖动效；专业设计师和 AE 老手也够用：关键帧、弹簧曲线、自定义轨迹全都能上手精调。Apache 2.0，由 Open Design 团队原班人马打造\nrepo 地址👉 https://t.co/ZcFKzvMA7r",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/tuturetom/status/2074429492974490089",
    "time": "2026-07-07 17:45",
    "created_at": "Tue Jul 07 09:45:06 +0000 2026",
    "id_str": "2074429492974490089",
    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "tuturetom",
    "nickname": "TutureTom",
    "text": "2）403 个精选动效 · 230 套 Skills · 59 套顶级设计系统 · 58 套 hyperframes 视频模板 · 2680 枚图标，全部与 Open Design 生态互通。还支持以插件形式导入你自己的设计资产——设计系统、动效库，From GitHub / 传 zip / 拖文件夹都行，导入即用 https://t.co/DAq6Ds5ssr",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/tuturetom/status/2074429495654678978",
    "time": "2026-07-07 17:45",
    "created_at": "Tue Jul 07 09:45:07 +0000 2026",
    "id_str": "2074429495654678978",
    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "tuturetom",
    "nickname": "TutureTom",
    "text": "3）Figma Motion 有的编辑能力这里全都有：时间轴、关键帧、预设、动效组件——还多了自定义轨迹动效。HTML 或视频里任意元素都能编辑：让 agent 改一句话的事，自己手动微调也随时接手 https://t.co/v3Y1yN8Uq9",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/tuturetom/status/2074429499345670579",
    "time": "2026-07-07 17:45",
    "created_at": "Tue Jul 07 09:45:08 +0000 2026",
    "id_str": "2074429499345670579",
    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "tuturetom",
    "nickname": "TutureTom",
    "text": "4）动效不是原型里的演示——滚动到、悬停、点击都是真触发。保存出来是纯 HTML，双击就播，部署就上线，重新打开还能继续编辑。 https://t.co/ketLLRb2O7",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/tuturetom/status/2074429501950345543",
    "time": "2026-07-07 17:45",
    "created_at": "Tue Jul 07 09:45:08 +0000 2026",
    "id_str": "2074429501950345543",
    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "tuturetom",
    "nickname": "TutureTom",
    "text": "5）完整的发布视频工坊：多镜头、流动过渡、逐字文字动效、运动路径。看到喜欢的视频直接丢 GIF 或视频进来当参考，照着复刻。导出 MP4 / GIF 无水印、不装 ffmpeg、不上云、不按次收费 https://t.co/mNYjjjnEDn",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/tuturetom/status/2074429504714408441",
    "time": "2026-07-07 17:45",
    "created_at": "Tue Jul 07 09:45:09 +0000 2026",
    "id_str": "2074429504714408441",
    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "tuturetom",
    "nickname": "TutureTom",
    "text": "6）自动识别你本地的 code agent——Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、OpenCode、Grok Build、Hermes、Gemini，顶栏一键切换，复用已登录会话零配置。本地一个 CLI 都没有？开通 Open Design Cloud 就能云端跑各种模型，长任务不中断，填个 API key直连也行 https://t.co/aJLTc6cdIV",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/tuturetom/status/2074429507327365361",
    "time": "2026-07-07 17:45",
    "created_at": "Tue Jul 07 09:45:10 +0000 2026",
    "id_str": "2074429507327365361",
    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "tuturetom",
    "nickname": "TutureTom",
    "text": "7）特别添加克制引擎。每个动效配方都带\"什么时候别用我\"的标注，时间轴检测到太多元素挤在同一入场窗口会直接警告你，亲身实践告诉我们好动效的秘密不是多，是收着用",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/tuturetom/status/2074429510624149867",
